{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_239_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_239","textTraditional":"一、十有二年。春，用田賦。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_239_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_239","textTraditional":"何以書？譏。何譏爾？譏始用田賦也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_239_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_239","textTraditional":"二、夏五月甲辰，孟子卒。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_239_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_239","textTraditional":"孟子者何？昭公之夫人也。其稱孟子何？諱娶同姓，蓋吳女也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_239_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_239","textTraditional":"三、公會吳于橐皐。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_239_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_239","textTraditional":"四、秋，公會衞侯、宋皇瑗于運。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_239_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_239","textTraditional":"五、宋向巢帥師伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_239_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_239","textTraditional":"六、冬十有二月，〈虫衆〉。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_239_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_239","textTraditional":"何以書？記異也。何異爾？不時也。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}